Package: linux-modules-generic
Version: {{ VER }}
Architecture: {{ ARCH }}
Maintainer: Gabriel Guillou <guillou.gabriel@gmail.com>
Section: kernel
Priority: optional
Depends: daemoncores-kernel-{{ KVER }} (= {{ VER }})
Description: Empty kernel modules meta-package (generic device class)
 This package contains NO kernel modules. It exists so the
 linux-modules-generic apt install line in Containerfile.minimal
 resolves to a real package name when DEVICE=generic (the default),
 instead of relying on apt silently ignoring an empty package name. It
 Depends on linux-image-common so apt pulls the common kernel image
 transitively.
